			"notes": "### Improvements\n The mod should now fully support all languages. Battle state tracking (stat boosts, weather, terrain, etc.) should display correctly regardless of your Minecraft language setting.\n\n**What's fixed:**\n     - Stat changes from moves (Shell Smash, Swords Dance, etc.) now track correctly in all languages\n     - Ability-triggered stat changes (Intimidate, etc.) work in all languages\n     - Weather, terrain, and field conditions display properly\n\nYou can now also provide translation resource packs for the UI! See [TRANSLATIONS.md](https://github.com/sveniik/CobblemonExtendedBattleUI/blob/main/TRANSLATIONS.md) for info."
		},
